  "writing_rules": [
    "Persist deviations, not defaults: full Qi, zero fatigue, healthy physiology, home location and empty training/medicine state are omitted.",
    "Roster faction is authoritative for membership; do not repeat faction/headquarters/representation on every person.",
    "Body mass is a direct physical fact. Health exists only for current non-default injury/physiology state.",
    "Static behavior is referenced by combat_doctrine_ref; never embed doctrine paragraphs in mutable person state.",
    "Training stores only current residual/evidence/focus required by deterministic progression; scheduler chronology is not copied into every person.",
    "Institutional training pause is a transient derived projection from current activity/location authority and is never persisted on a person."
  ],
